&lt;p&gt;The Bundeswehr is one of our primary target organizations in the public sector. With our &lt;strong&gt;Celonis for Defense &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt; initiative, presented at the Munich Security Conference 2026, we offer a sovereign and trusted platform that integrates data across systems and optimizes military processes along the entire value chain. This means &lt;strong&gt;higher&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;operational readiness&lt;/strong&gt; through optimized logistics and faster maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) cycles, greater resilience through end-to-end supply chain transparency, and faster IT modernization by connecting existing systems with modern AI applications. Building on our &lt;strong&gt;data analysis solution Metropolis&lt;/strong&gt;, we also help connect information from a wide range of sources into a &lt;strong&gt;comprehensive situational picture&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling faster and better-informed decisions &lt;strong&gt;during the actual mission&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To drive this forward, we are now complementing our existing Public Sector team with a highly specialized Account Executive who brings first-hand experience from inside the organization we serve: the &lt;strong&gt;Bundeswehr&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
