&lt;li&gt;Build and own relationships across the Bundeswehr – Army (Heer), Navy (Marine), Air Force (Luftwaffe) and Cyber and Information Domain Service (CIR) – and its ecosystem, e.g. the Federal Ministry of Defence (BMVg), the Federal Office of Bundeswehr Equipment, Information Technology and In-Service Support (BAAINBw) and BWI GmbH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with decision-makers from leadership, logistics, procurement, IT and digitalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate operational challenges into concrete, AI-enabled use cases with measurable impact, e.g. in logistics and supply, MRO and materiel readiness, supply chain resilience, procurement and IT modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the voice of the Bundeswehr into Celonis: share insights with our product, marketing and value engineering teams to sharpen our offering.&lt;/li&gt;
