&lt;li&gt;Represent Celonis at public sector and defense events and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Qualifications you need:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of professional experience &lt;strong&gt;within the Bundeswehr&lt;/strong&gt;, e.g. as an officer or civilian employee, ideally in a leadership role and/or in logistics, procurement, IT, digitalization, planning or organizational development.&lt;/li&gt;
