&lt;li&gt;Strong affinity for technology, data and AI, and the ability to explain complex topics in a simple and convincing way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders and to engage effectively at the leadership level.&lt;/li&gt;
